# ── Superseded builds ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# The two 6-29 builds are the pre-rewrite app: a 220 KB minified React
# bundle with six vanilla modules layered on top of it. They are kept on
# disk as history but deliberately NOT published, because both embed a
# live Supabase project URL and anon key. Nothing in the current app
# needs them.
ReWild Build 6-29.html
ReWild Build 6-29 with Supabase api.html

